From: Najip <najipmunajat22@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] manager: drop duplicate "val context" in NavContainer

NavContainer declares "val context = LocalContext.current" twice in the same
scope, which Kotlin rejects with REDECLARATION (compileReleaseKotlin fails).

diff --git a/manager/app/src/main/java/org/bakasu/bakasu/ui/NavContainer.kt b/manager/app/src/main/java/org/bakasu/bakasu/ui/NavContainer.kt
--- a/manager/app/src/main/java/org/bakasu/bakasu/ui/NavContainer.kt
+++ b/manager/app/src/main/java/org/bakasu/bakasu/ui/NavContainer.kt
@@ -240,7 +240,6 @@
         onResult = permissionRequestInterface::onPermissionRequestCallback,
     )

-    val context = LocalContext.current
     val uriHandler = LocalUriHandler.current

     CompositionLocalProvider(
